        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the life of Joe and make decisions that affect the story in this turn-based RPG which will have you pondering your own morality. You are thrown into a conspiracy involving the Necronomicon and murderous intentions with Satanic hopes. Get lost in the craziness and do your best to be good, or don't. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn-Based Combat - Challenge yourself with quick combat in an active time battle system which will keep you on your toes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Saving - Save your progress and return later. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No Grinding - All enemies are challenging and capable of killing you. You will not fight the same enemy a thousand times. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Item Management - You are limited in what you can hold and must store the excess.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voice Acting - Nearly every line is voice acted and will draw you into the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Make and Receive Phone Calls - Call mom or wait for the telemarketers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compelling Story - Play as the bad guy and pick up the pieces of a troubled life. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple Choices - Choose how you respond in most dialogue events. These choices will affect outcomes in the Gameworld. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Barter System - Trade items (not just cash) for what you want. <br>    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mini-Games - Multiple arcades and field abilities make playing more fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Can you be good when you were programmed to be evil?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>(Press F5 for Fullscreen)</strong></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the life of Joe and make decisions that affect the story in this turn-based RPG which will have you pondering your own morality. You are thrown into a conspiracy involving the Necronomicon and murderous intentions with Satanic hopes. Get lost in the craziness and do your best to be good, or don't. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn-Based Combat - Challenge yourself with quick combat in an active time battle system which will keep you on your toes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Saving - Save your progress and return later. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No Grinding - All enemies are challenging and capable of killing you. You will not fight the same enemy a thousand times. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Item Management - You are limited in what you can hold and must store the excess.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voice Acting - Nearly every line is voice acted and will draw you into the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Make and Receive Phone Calls - Call mom or wait for the telemarketers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compelling Story - Play as the bad guy and pick up the pieces of a troubled life. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple Choices - Choose how you respond in most dialogue events. These choices will affect outcomes in the Gameworld. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Barter System - Trade items (not just cash) for what you want. <br>    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mini-Games - Multiple arcades and field abilities make playing more fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Can you be good when you were programmed to be evil?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>(Press F5 for Fullscreen)</strong></p>",
        "short_description": "Enter the life of Joe and make decisions that affect the story in this turn-based RPG which will have you pondering your own morality.",
